---
const pageTitle = "CELLTEST POSITIVE | TheosDev";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js" is:inline></script>
    <style>
      body { background-color: #0f1115; color: #e2e8f0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.6; }
      .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 20px; }
      .back-btn { display: inline-block; color: #00e676; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 40px; transition: transform 0.2s; }
      .back-btn:hover { transform: translateX(-5px); }
      .project-header { margin-bottom: 50px; opacity: 0; }
      h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
      .subtitle { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #94a3b8; }
      .content-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 60px; opacity: 0; }
      @media (max-width: 768px) { .content-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
      h2 { color: #00e676; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,230,118,0.2); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 30px; }
      .tech-sidebar { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); height: fit-content; }
      .tech-item { margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .tech-item h4 { margin: 0 0 5px 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase;}
      .tech-item p { margin: 0; color: #f8fafc; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <div class="container">
      <a href="/en/projects" class="back-btn">← Back to Projects</a>

      <div class="project-header anim-element">
        <h1>CELLTEST POSITIVE</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Asymmetric 1v1 Online Strategy Card Game</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-grid anim-element">
        
        <div class="main-content">
          <h2>Core Gameplay</h2>
          <p>Rejecting traditional energy or mana mechanics, your only resource in CELLTEST POSITIVE is your own life force. Players start with 10 HP without any turn-based mana regeneration; every card played directly deducts from your health pool.</p>

          <h2>Asymmetric Architecture (Host vs Client)</h2>
          <p>Set within a microscopic biological war, the lobby host controls the spreading Cancer Cell while the joining client controls the defending Antibody system. This creates distinct gameplay mechanics and win conditions for both sides.</p>

          <h2>Battlefield & Tactics</h2>
          <p>The arena features Front and Back rows. Newly played cards spawn in the back row and must be advanced forward to engage in direct combat. Damaging the opponent permanently reduces both their current health and maximum health capacity.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-sidebar">
          <h3>Technical Overview</h3>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Role</h4><p>Game Programmer</p></div>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Engine</h4><p>Unity3D (C#)</p></div>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Networking</h4><p>Netcode for GameObjects (NGO)</p></div>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Key Systems</h4><p>Custom Room Code Lobby, Asymmetric State Sync, Turn Manager</p></div>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Status</h4><p>Completed (Game Jam Entry)</p></div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <script is:inline>
      document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
        gsap.to(".anim-element", { opacity: 1, y: -20, duration: 1, stagger: 0.2, ease: "power3.out" });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>